OL,5,G2305 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FParamedics fight to save a man
OL,7,     Fwhose heart has stopped for 50
OL,8,     Fminutes. And a 15-year-old boy is
OL,9,     Ffound unconscious in a Coventry
OL,10,     Fpark after drinking two litres of
OL,11,     Fwhisky.
OL,12,G0005 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FAlex, 77, has been rushed to St
OL,14,     FGeorge's with a suspected stroke.
OL,15,     FSteven, 66, has severe stomach
OL,16,     Fcramps. And 16-year-old Aaliyah's
OL,17,     Ffingernail has been badly damaged
OL,18,     Fin a fight.
